'''White Butler Vigler''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[White Day Capsules (Gacha Event)|White Day]] gacha event. He was added in [[Version 12.1 Update|Version 12.1]] and is a variant of [[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|Detective Vigler]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 693
|rarity = UR
|name1 = White Butler Vigler
|name2 = Black Butler Vigler
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Black Butler Vigler''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
White Butler Vigler has the same stats as the original [[Detective Vigler (Uber Rare Cat)|Vigler]], but, as normal, seasonal units have different targets. His abilities are all a coin flip, so with a 10-second attack cycle and long foreswing, he could just do nothing half the time. You may think that targeting Dark and Red enemies isn't a good niche, because you could use [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]] or [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] instead; while those units are good at what they do, they tend to struggle against hordes of peons/support, or enemies that outrange them. He also has the ability to hit enemies even when they are protected, thanks to his Wave Attacks.

Shield Piercing is somewhat random at a 50% chance, but ranged Shield Piercing is especially rare, which could prove to be of great use in his niches.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller & Breaker}}

